{
  "summary": "In LibreOffice Impress, presentation notes serve two main purposes: providing additional reference material for the audience on printed handouts and offering cues to guide the presenter during a delivery. To add notes to a slide, select the slide in the slides pane and switch to the Notes tab, where text can be typed into the notes text box beneath the slide. The text within the notes box can be formatted directly by adjusting the font type, changing the font size, and applying bullet points. To maintain consistent formatting across all notes, a Notes Master can be configured via View, Master, and Notes Master. Inside the Notes Master view, modifications made to the notes placeholder—such as altering text size and font color or inserting shapes and logos—automatically apply as defaults to all presentation notes. Finally, the layout can be customized by selecting and moving the slide placeholder, providing additional space to resize the notes placeholder.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "fact": "Notes in Impress serve as additional reference material for the audience or as cues to assist the presenter during a talk.",
      "evidence": "notes दो उद्देश्यों के लिए प्रयुक्त होता है दर्शकों के लिए प्रत्येक slide पर अतिरिक्त सामग्री या रेफ्रेन्सेस के लिए उद्घोषक को reference notes के ज़रिये मदद करने के लिए"
    },
    {
      "fact": "Clicking on the Notes tab displays a notes text box below the slide for typing notes.",
      "evidence": "notes के संपादन के लिए notes टैब पर click करें slide के नीचे एक notes text box प्रदर्शित होता है"
    },
    {
      "fact": "Notes text can be formatted directly using the font type dropdown, font size dropdown, and bullet icon.",
      "evidence": "font type dropdown पर click करें और tlwgmono चुनें अब font size dropdown में 18 चुनें उसी task bar में bullet icon पर click करें"
    },
    {
      "fact": "To create standard formatting for all notes, open the Notes Master by clicking View, then Master, and selecting Notes Master.",
      "evidence": "मुख्य menu में view पर click करें और फिर master पर click करें notes master पर click करें"
    },
    {
      "fact": "There is a notes master for each master slide utilized in the presentation.",
      "evidence": "इसका मतलब है कि प्रस्तुति में इस्तेमाल प्रत्येक master slide के लिए एक notes master होता है"
    },
    {
      "fact": "Formatting preferences set on the notes master apply automatically to all notes throughout the presentation.",
      "evidence": "आप यहाँ formatting प्राथमिकता निर्धारित कर सकते हैं जोकि बाद में प्रस्तुति में सभी notes पर लागू होगी"
    },
    {
      "fact": "Text formatting in the notes master can be adjusted by choosing options such as font size 32 and red font color under Character dialog box.",
      "evidence": "font size dropdown पर click करें और 32 चुनें मुख्य menu में format और character पर click करें character dialog box प्रदर्शित होता है font effects टैब पर click करें font color dropdown पर click करें और red चुनें"
    },
    {
      "fact": "Shapes such as an isosceles triangle can be added from Basic Shapes on the drawing toolbar to act as a logo.",
      "evidence": "drawing toolbar से basic shapes पर click करें और isosceles triangle चुनें"
    },
    {
      "fact": "A shape's fill color can be modified via Area in the context menu by selecting Color and choosing Blue 7.",
      "evidence": "area पर click करें area dialog box प्रदर्शित होता है area टैब पर click करें fill dropdown पर click करें और color पर click करें अब blue 7 चुनें"
    },
    {
      "fact": "Moving the slide placeholder towards the top of the screen creates more space to resize the notes placeholder.",
      "evidence": "slide placeholder चुनें बायाँ mouse button दबाएँ और इसे screen पर सबसे ऊपर ले जाएँ यह notes place holder का आकार बदलने के लिए अधिक स्थान बनाता है"
    }
  ]
}
